					{
						"sceneId": 20360,
						"position": [
							-1956.488,
							-40.164,
							-40.857
						],
						"pointId": 8
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 20360,
						"position": [
							-1955.655,
							-40.164,
							-40.547
						],
						"pointId": 9
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 762030301,
					"content": "Is that an Irminsul tree?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030302,
					"content": "Oh, this painting here? You're clearly no strangers to the white trees... but did you know that the first angel's betrayal happened beneath one of their very boughs?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030303,
						762030304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030303,
					"content": "I don't think so.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 762030305,
					"content": "Huh, Paimon's curious now!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030306,
					"content": "Well then, I guess it's finally time for me to tell you a tale of romance and horror. Let me just think how best to protect the identity of those involved... Alright, got it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030307,
					"content": "A long, long time ago, there was once a traveler who wandered among the stars. They were nothing like you... but that's not important right now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030308,
					"content": "One day, he traveled to a silver tree to visit the Princess of the Morning Star. Before long, he started asking her about her kingdom's most forbidden secrets.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030309,
					"content": "His words puzzled the princess. How could he possibly know of all these things forbidden by the gods?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030310,
					"content": "The young man revealed his origins and showed the princess things she had never seen before — of free will and love, both noble and spiritual.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030311,
					"content": "His words awakened her sense of self, hitherto shackled by the gods. Her heart soared, carrying her beyond limits she had never crossed before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030312,
					"content": "The Princess of the Morning Star confided the kingdom's secrets to the youth, and between them, love grew and blossomed — along with a determination to defy the gods.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030313,
					"content": "This is just a cookie-cutter love story! You said there'd be horror...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030314,
					"content": "Don't worry, Paimon, the horror's about to begin. They yearned to help the people live lives of unfettered freedom, but the gods could not forgive their betrayal.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030315,
					"content": "They sent down thunder and fury, destroying the lovers' home. And when the great war subsided, the power and the wisdom of the princess were lost, never to return...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030316,
					"content": "Even her closest friends were cursed...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030317,
					"content": "...Uhhh, yeah... That ending was pretty scary, after all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030318,
					"content": "But didn't you say you were going to tell us about the first angel? And, and... you're not saying this story's actually true, are you...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030319,
					"content": "It sure is, and that's the scariest part.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030320,
					"content": "Well then, I guess it's finally time for me to tell you a tale of romance and horror.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030321,
					"content": "Let me just think how best to protect the identity of those involved...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762030322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762030322,
